repository-code: "https://github.com/swntsvt/kgsemembed"
abstract: >-
  Phase 2 of a three-phase knowledge graph alignment study: verbalisation
  strategies and sentence-embedding models re-rank the top-20 character
  n-gram candidates of each source entity on five OAEI and OpenEA datasets,
  compared with the stage-1 n-gram order. The release's data archive holds
  every stored result, per-source sidecar, the baseline and the candidate
  lists (URIs, scores and metrics only; no dataset text).
keywords:
  - knowledge graph alignment
  - ontology matching
  - entity alignment
  - sentence embeddings
  - verbalisation
